    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "auto_off_box", "x": 50, "y": 1200, "width": 2150, "height": 130, "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 400210, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400211, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "auto_off_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "auto_off_t", "x": 65, "y": 1215, "width": 2120, "height": 100, "text": "⑩ max_on_duration timer (예: 600s 후 자동 OFF)\n→ HAL.GPIOSet(17, 0)  →  BCM 17 = LOW  →  환기팬 OFF\n→ MQTT publish gw/GW-001/event { \"event\": \"max_on_auto_off\", \"actuator_channel_id\": \"relay-vent\", ... }\n⑪ panic 또는 systemd restart 시 → defer hal.AssertSafeState() → 모든 OUTPUT pin = 0 (NC = open = safe)", "originalText": "⑩ max_on_duration timer (예: 600s 후 자동 OFF)\n→ HAL.GPIOSet(17, 0)  →  BCM 17 = LOW  →  환기팬 OFF\n→ MQTT publish gw/GW-001/event { \"event\": \"max_on_auto_off\", \"actuator_channel_id\": \"relay-vent\", ... }\n⑪ panic 또는 systemd restart 시 → defer hal.AssertSafeState() → 모든 OUTPUT pin = 0 (NC = open = safe)", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 400212, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400213, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "auto_off_box", "lineHeight": 1.5}
